\newlabel{fig:training-dynamics}{{3}{12}{Interim EMA diagnostics for four seed-0 development runs on the same deterministic five-case monitoring cohort. The snapshot contains concat fixed, concat random, concat weighted, and exploratory FiLM weighted runs. Fixed-mask monitoring occurs every 5,000 steps and augmented-run monitoring every 10,000 steps. Curves end at the latest available event and are not used for checkpoint or method selection. Final claims use the predeclared development and confirmation cohorts}{figure.3}{}}
